 THIS SECOND APPROACH IS PROVIDED TO US BY DEFAULT IN REACT BY USE EFFECT
 
 What is useEffect?
useEffect is  a function .You can  called this function by passing another callback function into it."useEffect is a function which takes a callback function as a parameter.useEffect is a function which takes a callback function as a parameter.
useEffect will not call the passed callback function immedjiately,it will call it whenever it wants.So whenever useEffect wants to call callback function,it will call it.React will make sure it that this callback function is called at a specific time.What is that time? Whenever our component renders and re renders and again re renders,useEffect will call the passed callback function after every render.(Jab b hamara component render hu ga tab tab useEffect passed callback function ko call krta rhy ga).
useEffect(()=>{console.log('kesa')});

